{"id":"c16","kind":"web","text":"effort 는 정해진 토큰 상한으로 작동하지 않고, 낮은 단계에서도 충분히 어려운 문제에는 생각한다","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w3 §Effort levels","evidence":[{"source":"w3","locator":"§Effort levels","quote":"Effort is a behavioral signal, not a strict token budget. At lower effort levels, Claude still thinks on sufficiently difficult problems, but thinks less than it would at higher effort levels for the same problem."}]}
{"id":"c17","kind":"web","text":"effort 는 모든 출력 토큰에 걸려 thinking 이 없어도 작동하고, 낮은 단계에서는 tool call 이 적고 짧아진다","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w3 §How effort works","evidence":[{"source":"w3","locator":"§How effort works","quote":"Because effort applies to every output token, it works with or without thinking. Lower effort also means fewer and terser tool calls."}]}
{"id":"c18","kind":"web","text":"Claude Code 문서는 effort 가 adaptive reasoning 을 조절해 모델이 단계마다 생각할지와 얼마나 생각할지를 정한다고 설명한다","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"w2 §Adjust effort level","evidence":[{"source":"w2","locator":"§Adjust effort level","quote":"control adaptive reasoning, which lets the model decide whether and how much to think on each step based on task complexity."}]}
